IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0008.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY FRD0008C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 RISK-LVL           PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-LVL=" RISK-LVL
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN TRAN-CNT-DAY GREATER THAN 20
           AND TXN-AMOUNT GREATER THAN 7000
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN TRAN-CNT-DAY GREATER THAN 8
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN ACCT-AGE-DAYS < 60
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
